"<div className=\"simulator-callout\">\n"
"  <strong>No IBM Quantum account needed.</strong> Code runs on a built-in simulator by default. Add your API key in <a href=\"/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum\">Settings</a> only if you want real quantum hardware.\n"
